'''Hatsuyume Mikan''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]]. It can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] gacha event.

